) account","p":"N","tr":"l-ḥisābi","f":["VN","(III)","M","GEN"],"r":102,"l":301,"g":[["ٱلْ","DET","prefix","Al"],["حِسَابِ","N","stem","VN|(III)|M|GEN"]]},{"e":"٢٠٢","v":"2:202"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"2:197","t":"Ḥajj is [during] well-known months, so whoever has made ḥajj obligatory upon himself therein [by entering the state of iḥrām], there is [to be for him] no sexual relations and no disobedience and no disputing during ḥajj. And whatever good you do - Allāh knows it. And take provisions, but indeed, the best provision is fear of Allāh. And fear Me, O you of understanding.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":197,"sd":null},{"k":"2:198","t":"There is no blame upon you for seeking bounty from your Lord [during ḥajj]. But when you depart from ʿArafāt, remember Allāh at al-Mashʿar al-Ḥarām. And remember Him, as He has guided you, for indeed, you were before that among those astray.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":198,"sd":null},{"k":"2:199","t":"Then depart from the place from where [all] the people depart and ask forgiveness of Allāh. Indeed, Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":199,"sd":null},{"k":"2:200","t":"And when you have completed your rites, remember Allāh like your [previous] remembrance of your fathers or with [much] greater remembrance. And among the people is he who says, \"Our Lord, give us in this world,\" and he will have in the Hereafter no share.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":200,"sd":null},{"k":"2:201","t":"But among them is he who says, \"Our Lord, give us in this world [that which is] good and in the Hereafter [that which is] good and protect us from the punishment of the Fire.\"","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":201,"sd":null},{"k":"2:202","t":"Those will have a share of what they have earned, and Allāh is swift in account.","j":2,"h":3,"s":2,"a":202,"sd":null}],"juz":2,"hizb":3,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}